{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>53歲前亞洲小姐冠軍吳綺莉日前罕有現身訪談節目《九運會客室2》，親自開腔回應多年來圍繞她與女兒吳卓林身世各種流 …</p><p></p>\n<p>53歲前亞洲小姐冠軍吳綺莉日前罕有現身訪談節目《九運會客室2》，親自開腔回應多年來圍繞她與女兒吳卓林身世各種流言蜚語。面對網上瘋傳關於她私生活混亂及拒做親子鑑定等指控，她首度在鏡頭前作出強硬反擊並透露已交由律師處理。這位單親媽媽更親口揭露了男方多年來支付撫養費背後不為人知真實情況。\n</p>\n<h2>吳綺莉作客《九運會客室2》親解傳聞</h2>\n<p>吳綺莉日前獲邀作客訪談節目《九運會客室2》，與昔日同為亞姐出身的主持人伍詠薇及李凱賢大談單親媽媽心路歷程。近年網絡不時流傳各種揣測，甚至有自媒體造謠指她當年因拒做親子鑑定才導致男方拒認女兒。對此她在節目中罕有地強硬反擊，直指這些憑空捏造謊言嚴重踐踏其做人底線。針對滿天飛傳聞她斬釘截鐵逐一反駁，坦言起初選擇清者自清，未料沉默反而讓失實影片肆意蔓延。</p>\n<h2>吳綺莉強烈否認私生活混亂指控</h2>\n<p>面對無中生有指控，吳綺莉在鏡頭前強烈表達不滿：「我好唔鍾意俾人屈囉！係我就係㗎，唔係就唔係……唔知邊個啦，即係啲網冇張相嘅，啲名好奇怪嘅，出嚟話我私生活好混亂。」她強調從來無人要求她進行親子鑑定，並重申自己私生活絕不混亂，目前已將所有侵權內容全權交由內地律師循法律途徑追究到底。當伍詠薇單刀直入追問男方過去曾否給予任何經濟支援時，她毫不猶豫地直言：「冇喎，從來都冇喎！」\n</p>\n<h2>堅拒向吳卓林提及生父成龍恩怨</h2>\n<p>當年吳綺莉與影壇巨星成龍爆出婚外情轟動全城，誕下女兒吳卓林後長年背負輿論標籤。獨力撫養女兒長大過程中，她從未與卓林主動提起成龍，原來這份沉默源於她5歲時父母離異所經歷一場童年創傷。她憶述當年親戚長輩在飯桌上毫無顧忌地對她冷嘲熱諷，這段陰影深深烙印在她心頭。她暗下決心絕不讓上一代恩怨複製到下一代，深信感情破裂沒有誰對誰錯，孩子永遠是無辜，因此堅持不在女兒面前談論任何負面恩怨。</p>\n<h2>網民熱烈討論單親媽媽坎坷經歷</h2>\n<p>節目播出後隨即引發大批觀眾關注，網上湧現不少關於這段昔日恩怨討論。有網民十分同情她多年來獨力湊大女兒處境，留言表示「單親媽媽真係唔容易，仲要面對咁多流言蜚語」、「為母則剛，支持佢用法律保護自己」。同時也有部分網民對男方多年來未曾支付分毫撫養費感到驚訝，直斥「大人之間無論發生咩事，都應該對親生骨肉負責任」。不少人認同她保護女兒做法，認為不將上一代恩怨強加於下一代身上是明智之舉。\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179309803900881709_11267090366ae08137579f0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"吳綺莉 九運會客室2 吳綺莉作客《九運會客室2》，罕有開腔談及她與女兒吳卓林多年來面對的傳聞。（圖片來源：YouTube@HOYTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179309803900881709_11267090366ae08137579f0.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>吳綺莉作客《九運會客室2》，罕有開腔談及她與女兒吳卓林多年來面對的傳聞。（圖片來源：YouTube@HOYTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179309804046986556_13312512906ae08138cb5b5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"吳綺莉 九運會客室2 對於被指因拒驗DNA而令男方不認女，吳綺莉在節目中明確否認相關說法；更坦言最不喜歡被冤枉，面對失實指控直言：「係我就係㗎，唔係就唔係。」（圖片來源：YouTube@HOYTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179309804046986556_13312512906ae08138cb5b5.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>對於被指因拒驗DNA而令男方不認女，吳綺莉在節目中明確否認相關說法；更坦言最不喜歡被冤枉，面對失實指控直言：「係我就係㗎，唔係就唔係。」（圖片來源：YouTube@HOYTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179309804225392766_6479111566ae0813a8c312.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"吳綺莉 九運會客室2 被問及有否收過男方的經濟支援，吳綺莉直言：「冇喎，從來都冇喎！」（圖片來源：YouTube@HOYTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179309804225392766_6479111566ae0813a8c312.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>被問及有否收過男方的經濟支援，吳綺莉直言：「冇喎，從來都冇喎！」（圖片來源：YouTube@HOYTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179309804382982230_463008686ae0813c2d80c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"吳綺莉 九運會客室2 （圖片來源：吳綺莉社交網）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179309804382982230_463008686ae0813c2d80c.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：吳綺莉社交網）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179309804457314075_10904184086ae0813cd8e08.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"吳綺莉 九運會客室2 (圖片來源：微博@吳綺莉Elanie)\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179309804457314075_10904184086ae0813cd8e08.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：微博@吳綺莉Elanie)</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179309804661341393_5297191816ae0813ed995d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"吳綺莉 九運會客室2 （圖片來源：微博@吳綺莉Elanie）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179309804661341393_5297191816ae0813ed995d.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：微博@吳綺莉Elanie）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e4%b9%9d%e9%81%8b%e6%9c%83%e5%ae%a2%e5%ae%a42/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">九運會客室2</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%90%b3%e5%8d%93%e6%9e%97/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">吳卓林</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%90%b3%e7%b6%ba%e8%8e%89/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">吳綺莉</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：YouTube@HOYTV、吳綺莉社交網、微博@吳綺莉Elanie資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3531222\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nOct 27 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T12:42:08.985950+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1607,"images":6,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T10:47:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T12:38:41.514319+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T12:38:41.514319+00:00","content_hash":"2004316505fb0a18ba819668afec2ae027a8d614479fdfd67ddfb09ab007c09a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}